     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">All, I have found the solution thanks to kind soul over at StackOverflow.  You just use renderUI and uiOutput as such:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">server.R</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">    shinyServer(function(input, output) {</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">      output$code &lt;- renderUI({   </div></div></div>"
